ir web exec tsc -b` and `pnpm --dir web lint`. I didn't run the app inside the Electron shell, so I haven't watched a real startup update status arrive.\n\nIn `web/src/bridge.ts` I added `startShellStore()` right after `storeOfGlobal()`, with the doc comment from the spec. It is called once at module level, right after its definition. The doc comments on `shellStore` and `useShell` now say the store is made at start rather than at the first `useShell()`. Nothing else changed.", "ttft_ms": 1923, "type": "result", "duration_ms": 18285, "uuid": "8a21e4ef-ad59-4194-8eac-70c8830c5e6e", "ttft_stream_ms": 1243, "time_to_request_ms": 55, "first_content_frame_ms": 1243, "queued_turn_count": 0, "result_index": 0}
